 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T42Q974a1-UQ7kNvwH6PySX&_nc_oc=AdqlHrSNZcByJ8eu4w5BluxtQGCFrVMSBmhcjNIy2CgSiljbw0yLzqVd6giujbzSWxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoB76BRPP6B8TEqZKwAODAB8lLbmOO8f47CTF6tysg5A&oe=6AA02741"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fc9Ti4z2f20Q7kNvwFN_0Vk&_nc_oc=AdriZde1O_Hd3uG8ZIwBIaa1eiQ1BDu2c5Ypa4mqsQV2v-zzJZieM_NH3-7iX7y7zHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIwhROf8FRGYqt7RCP94tRHVnf5xdrFJIEeior7bluLbA&oe=6A9FFC66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gZ-Fwe_GUjUQ7kNvwHfNJpg&_nc_oc=AdpK6S2nIKjK8zr-KMMmAA81eEfY8-rs7QNc0HR5wn3bvBE3KAtpfQaAU4-19qRmQTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7BrpI5kpbYzO_p4kNHHebF5_isbiazFWjFrL7Fjo_dw&oe=6AA0065C"}, {"fil